I left out the two operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the WIT world can't import a filesystem or HTTP interface, so the log write and the metadata fetch can't be compiled into it. The metadata URL would also send each item's untrusted text to a host outside any granted allowlist. Those would need a graph-level change that grants the capabilities explicitly.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{classified-item, item-verdict};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(classified: classified-item) -> item-verdict;
}
```

